  J=5: all 162 unit classes mod 3^5: three lifts (same k) map bijectively onto the three lifts of G(a) mod 3^4  [checked]
  J=6: all 486 unit classes mod 3^6: three lifts (same k) map bijectively onto the three lifts of G(a) mod 3^5  [checked]
  J=7: all 1458 unit classes mod 3^7: three lifts (same k) map bijectively onto the three lifts of G(a) mod 3^6  [checked]
  sharpness J=1: witness (a, a+3^J, G mod 3^J) = (1, 1, 7, 1, 2)
  sharpness J=2: witness (a, a+3^J, G mod 3^J) = (2, 1, 10, 1, 4)
