  J=5: supp P_J^n(a,.) = {c = G^n(a) mod 3^(J-n)} for n<J and = all 162 classes for n=J  [checked all a]
  J=6: supp P_J^n(a,.) = {c = G^n(a) mod 3^(J-n)} for n<J and = all 486 classes for n=J  [checked all a]
